# Note: .gitignore tells Git which untracked files it should normally ignore.
# It is NOT a security system. 
# A PDF can be useful documentation. Only ignore PDFs if they are large, sensitive, or not meant to be version-controlled.
# Also, .gitignore does not remove a file that has already been committed.
